  "description": "Radiant is a step-through commuter electric bike with a 500W rear hub motor, torque-sensing pedal assist and a 48V 15Ah LG-cell battery. Its integrated display, concealed cables, 26 × 2.35-inch tires and included rear rack combine city riding with everyday carrying utility. What makes Radiant a minimalist commuter electric bike? Radiant brings a step-through frame, concealed cable routing and an integrated display into one city-focused design. Its 500W rear hub motor supports everyday commuting, while 26-inch wheels and a rear rack provide the essentials for work trips and local errands. How does torque-sensing assist respond to your pedaling? A torque sensor adjusts motor assistance to your pedaling effort, with five assist levels for changing routes. The 500W rear hub motor helps with starts and climbs, while Shimano 7-speed gearing lets you choose a pedaling rhythm for town streets and paved paths. How does the integrated display simplify the cockpit? The embedded display keeps ride information within the handlebar layout instead of adding a separate raised screen. Together with concealed cables and a 6061 aluminum frame, it reduces visual clutter on a commuter electric bicycle built around daily city use. What does a 15Ah battery offer for city riding? Radiant's 48V 15Ah LG-cell battery stores 720Wh of nominal energy within the frame. It supplies pedal assistance for commuting and leisure routes, while a twist throttle gives motor support without pedaling when you want an alternative to the five assist levels. How do tires and lighting support the daily commute? The 26 × 2.35-inch puncture-resistant tires include reflective sidewalls for visibility in low light. A 45-lux headlight and integrated rear light support everyday travel, while front suspension and Tektro mechanical disc brakes help manage uneven pavement and frequent stops. Can a step-through commuter bike carry everyday essentials? Radiant includes a rear rack and full fenders for work trips and shopping. Add a compatible bag or basket to carry daily items. The step-through frame has a 21.3-inch standover height, and the 350 lb total payload includes the rider, cargo and accessories.",
